Description: video background for the Cinnamon screensaver and lock screen
 Plays a looping video file (MP4, WebM, MKV, ...) behind Cinnamon's own
 screensaver and lock screen, in place of the wallpaper. The unlock dialog,
 clock, authentication, timers and multi-monitor handling remain those of
 cinnamon-screensaver.
 .
 Settings appear as a "Video" tab on the Screensaver page of Cinnamon's
 System Settings. If the video can't be played, the normal wallpaper is
 shown.
